destination.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The destination posts to the collector’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/com.snowplowanalytics.snowplow\/tp2"},{"type":"text","text":", the tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protocol’s endpoint, encoded by a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" within"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/batchLimit"},{"type":"text","text":", and sends no trace context in its header fields. It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retries no response, a 5xx, 408 or 429, and drops and reports any other status, such as 413"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for a body over the collector’s limit."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every request carries ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SP-Anonymous: *"},{"text":", so the collector sets no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sp"},{"text":" cookie, reads none,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"network_userid"},{"text":" as all zeros, and records no IP address or forwarding header fields.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Without it the collector would set a cookie that ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession"},{"text":" keeps and sends back, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identifier lasting across sessions (D4).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A collector takes events from anyone who can reach it, so the destination needs no key or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","t